  unitName: Captain Mega
  unitId: 20122
  unitNumber: 156
  description: A pirate captain from the seas near the ruined Sama Kingdom.He was
    raised by Verica after being found in a shipwreck of which he was the only survivor.
    When Mega inherited the captain's chair from Verica he gained the trust of his
    crew as well as the local pirates due to his good humored nature and incredible
    skill with an axe. He became known as the Captain.
  summonDesc: I am the axe captain!<br>I see you've been waiting for me. You will
    not be disappointed!
  fusionDesc: Well, isn't this fun!<br>The sea roars at my strength!
